 '112 × 112 × 64'        → addLabel rot -33° + leader arrow
 stage-1 ResBlocks (×4)  → BoxGeometry(0.55, 0.90, 0.90)  #A8BFCE/#C6D6DF/#5F7E8F + EdgesGeometry
 stage-2 ResBlocks (×2)  → BoxGeometry(0.80, 0.55, 0.55)
 stage-3 ResBlocks (×3)  → BoxGeometry(1.30, 0.34, 0.34)
 stage-4 ResBlocks (×3)  → BoxGeometry(2.20, 0.20, 0.20)
 logit bars (×2)         → BoxGeometry(0.12, 0.52/0.52, 0.12) teal #B6DFDA + 3 CircleGeometry dots
 stage brackets          → 2 Lines + 3 CircleGeometry ellipsis dots + Cone arrows down-left
 'N blocks total'        → addLabel (distinct per gap) + 2 CircleGeometry dots
 bottom callouts         → Line + Cone arrows up-right, addLabel rot -33°
 inset panel             → Shape(rounded rect) → ShapeGeometry fill + Line border (upper right)
 inset cube              → BoxGeometry(0.44, 0.78, 0.78) × insetScale
 inset chain boxes       → PlaneGeometry + EdgesGeometry (BN #E2804F, ReLU #A6DCD2, Conv white)
